@file FLT/KnownIn1980s/EllipticCurves/ReductionBaseChange.lean
@decl ValuativeExtension.residueMap
-- L4DEL: title: The induced map of residue fields `𝒪[k]/𝓂[k] →+* 𝒪[l]/𝓂[l]`, from the local homomorphism `integerMap`
-- L4DEL: intuition: The induced map of residue fields `𝒪[k]/𝓂[k] →+* 𝒪[l]/𝓂[l]`, from the local homomorphism `integerMap`. (An honest definition, not a sorry: it is `IsLocalRing.ResidueField.map` of `integerMap k l`.)
