-- L4DEL: intuition: The rational-function identity `v/(1-v)² + 2v²/(1-v)³ = v(1+v)/(1-v)³` recombining the `XAn` and `YAn` summands into the `℘'` row sums (also true at the junk value `v = 1`, where all terms are `0`).
-- L4DEL: step: This explanation is a condensed rendering of the declaration's own doc comment at the pinned source commit; consult the exact Lean statement below for authority.

