-- L4DEL: intuition: The formal series `1/j = Δ(q)/c₄(q)³ = q - 744q² + 356652q³ - ⋯ ∈ ℤ⟦q⟧`: the reciprocal of the `j`-invariant of the Tate curve. Since `c₄³` has constant coefficient `1` its inverse `PowerSeries.invOfUnit (c₄Formal ^ 3) 1` has integer coefficients: no denominators are introduced.
-- L4DEL: step: This explanation is a condensed rendering of the declaration's own doc comment at the pinned source commit; consult the exact Lean statement below for authority.

