-- L4DEL: intuition: `c₆(E) = 0` if and only if `j(E) = 1728`, by the relation `1728·Δ = c₄³ - c₆²`. This is the analogue for `j = 1728` of `WeierstrassCurve.j_eq_zero_iff` (`j = 0 ↔ c₄ = 0`).
