@decl IsDiscreteValuationRing.injective_of_not_maximalIdeal_le_ker
-- L4DEL: title: Documented declaration: injective_of_not_maximalIdeal_le_ker
-- L4DEL: intuition: A ring homomorphism from a discrete valuation ring to a domain is injective as soon as its kernel does not contain the maximal ideal: the kernel is a prime ideal, so it is either `⊥` or the maximal ideal.
